 2022 |website=[[Screen Rant]]}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Turner |first=Molly |date=May 31, 2022 |title=Star Wars Movie Villains Ranked Least To Most Powerful |url=https://www.slashfilm.com/591520/star-wars-movie-villains-ranked-least-to-most-powerful/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220611084010/https://www.slashfilm.com/591520/star-wars-movie-villains-ranked-least-to-most-powerful/ |archive-date=June 11, 2022 |access-date=June 6, 2022 |website=[[/Film]]}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Roberts |first=Daniel |date=December 15, 2021 |title=7 Popular 'Star Wars' Villains Ranked Worst to Best |url=https://insidethemagic.net/2021/12/star-wars-villains-ranked-dr1/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220604194137/https://insidethemagic.net/2021/12/star-wars-villains-ranked-dr1/ |archive-date=June 4, 2022 |access-date=June 6, 2022 |website=InsideTheMagic.com}}</ref><ref name="CBR">{{Cite web |last=Zimmerman |first=David |date=May 25, 2021 |title=Star Wars: All Movie Villains, Ranked By Strength |url=https://www.cbr.com/star-wars-strongest-movie-villains/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230415114017/https://www.cbr.com/star-wars-strongest-movie-villains/ |archive-date=April 15, 2023 |access-date=June 6, 2022 |website=[[Comic Book Resources|CBR]]}}</ref>

